scorecard.summary:
The best relationship and output story: typed references, route.ingress/db.rw.egress(), and a writer-returned RenderedDirectory with rules attached. Every mechanism was run in the venv. It lost points for:
- JSON-patch mixins as the core policy mechanism (eager with_() silently skips);
- many new classes;
- SecretCopy's per-pair stores, which bypass the roster;
- churn at 183+324+25 sites.
Taken into the synthesis: references, RenderedDirectory, and the single-shot relationship idea.
